      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.21 (up from ₹0.10 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹149.0m (up 94% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.88m (up 102% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.3% (in line with 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 65% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 13% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
